# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As long as the Qiskit C API has not yet reached feature parity with its Python API, some components of this package remain exclusive to its Python API, too. This includes the entire circuit library ([`qiskit_fermions.circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit#module-qiskit_fermions.circuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit\")) as well as transpiler passes ([`qiskit_fermions.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler#module-qiskit_fermions.transpiler \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler\")).\n"
msgstr "כל עוד ה-C API של Qiskit עדיין לא הגיע לשוויון יכולות עם ה-API של Python, חלק מרכיבי החבילה הזו נשארים זמינים רק ב-API של Python. זה כולל את כל ספריית המעגלים ([`qiskit_fermions.circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit#module-qiskit_fermions.circuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit\")) וכן את מעברי ה-Transpiler ([`qiskit_fermions.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler#module-qiskit_fermions.transpiler \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler\")).\n"

